{"title":"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While eating out, Mike and Joe each tipped their server <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Mike tipped <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of his bill and Joe tipped <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of his bill. What was the difference, in dollars, between their bills? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/7765e7e5412a3216b1eecc3dd9550ee9b16d4322.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 4\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 5\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 10\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be Mike's bill and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> be Joe's bill (both in dollars). We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b7c290caa8df05118ee3e36c847467bd60dd73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{100}m = 2 \\iff m = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"194\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42a0b981fffb543384d94d3976dc050047a353f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{100}j = 2 \\iff j = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />, so the desired difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5f5e9c6eaf3de05ee41b94969778ebb4be8b88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lvert m-j\\right\\rvert = 20-10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"231\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OT47ZnF5MPY\">https://youtu.be/OT47ZnF5MPY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mApPRP9v_XE\">https://youtu.be/mApPRP9v_XE</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A\">2005 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"20